<title>USA: Precision Systems CEO Pillar to resign.</title>
<headline>Precision Systems CEO Pillar to resign.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Systems Inc said Wednesday that Russell Pillar, its president and chief executive officer, plans to resign from the company.</p>
<p>A search committee has been formed to find a successor and has asked Pillar to remain in his posts until a replacement can be found, a statement from the company said.</p>
<p>Pillar became chief executive nearly three years ago, a statement from the company said.</p>
